    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45739" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφημερ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>diary, journal</i>, esp. <i>a military record</i>, as
			kept by Alexander's staff, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.434b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.25.1
			</span></i>; of Caesar's <i>commentarii</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; of office <i>registers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1168.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>day-book, account-book,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PCornell
