				2.829c
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.86
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὰς ἐ. φιλοσοφεῖν</span>
			to profess philosophy for the <i>ledger</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.999a
			</span></i>. </div>
